    a text called 'the child name' is 'gen process witness'.
    a text called 'the child line' is "a number called {'the child name'} is fork the process".
    a text called 'the exec branch' is "If {'the child name'} is 0 then, Execute \"{'the program'}\"".
    a number called 'the alias draw' is 'rng below' of 2.
